{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "BigCommerce Abandoned Cart Emails Addresses API",
    "version": "3.0.0"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "apikey",
      "key": "X-Auth-Token",
      "value": "{{X-Auth-Token}}",
      "placement": "header"
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Addresses",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Get All Customer Addresses",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.bigcommerce.com/stores/{store_hash}/v3/customers/addresses",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Accept",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Page number. `page=1`"
              },
              {
                "name": "limit",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Items count per page. `limit=50`"
              },
              {
                "name": "company:in",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter items by company. `company:in=bigcommerce,commongood`"
              },
              {
                "name": "name:in",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter items by first_name and last_name. `name:in=James+Moriarty`"
              },
              {
                "name": "customer_id:in",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter by the ID of the customer. Also accepts comma-separated IDs to filter for multiple customers. `customer_id:in=23,24,55`"
              },
              {
                "name": "include",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Indicates whether to include customer address sub-resources:\n* `formfields` - address form fields\n`include=formfields`"
              },
              {
                "name": "id:in",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter items by ID.\n`id:in=4,5,6`"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns a list of Customer Addresses. Optional filter parameters can be passed in."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Create a Customer Address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.bigcommerce.com/stores/{store_hash}/v3/customers/addresses",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Accept",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a Customer Address. Multiple customer addresses can be created in one call.\n\n**Required Fields**\n* **customer_id**\n* **first_name**\n* **last_name**\n* **city**\n* **country_code**\n* **address1**\n\n**Notes**\n* A unique customer address is a combination of the following core address fields:\n  * **customer_id**\n  * **first_name**\n  * **last_name**\n  * **company**\n  * **phone**\n  * **address_type**\n  * **address1**\n  * **address2**\n  * **city**\n  * **country_code**\n  * **state_or_province**\n  *"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Update a Customer Address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://api.bigcommerce.com/stores/{store_hash}/v3/customers/addresses",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Accept",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates a Customer Address. Multiple customer addresses can be updated in one call.\n\n**Required Fields**\n* **id** -- ID of the *Customer Address*\n\n**Limits**\n* Limit of **3** concurrent requests.\n\n**Notes**\n* A unique customer address is a combination of the following core address fields:\n  * **first_name**\n  * **last_name**\n  * **company**\n  * **phone**\n  * **address_type**\n  * **address1**\n  * **address2**\n  * **city**\n  * **country_code**\n  * **state_or_province**\n  * **postal_code**\n* An att"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Delete a Customer Address",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://api.bigcommerce.com/stores/{store_hash}/v3/customers/addresses",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Accept",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id:in",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter items by ID.\n`id:in=4,5,6`"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Deletes a Customer Address.\n\n**Required Query**\n* id:in -- ID of the *Customer Address*"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}